<title>FINLAND: Finnish Oct export prices fall 3.7 pct yr/yr -SF.</title>
<headline>Finnish Oct export prices fall 3.7 pct yr/yr -SF.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish markka-denominated export prices rose 0.3 percent in October on September and they fell 3.7 percent year-on-year, Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>			Oct 1996	  Sept 1996	Oct 1995</p>
<p> Mth/mth	    +0.3 pct	   -0.5 pct	 +0.8 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr		-3.7 pct	   -3.2 pct	 +9.2 pct</p>
<p>Markka-denominated import prices rose 0.6 percent month-on-month in October and they rose 3.3 percent year-on-year, SF said.</p>
<p>			 Oct 1996	   Sept 1996    Sept 1995</p>
<p> Mth/mth	     +0.6 pct	    +0.5 pct     -0.7 pct</p>
<p> Yr/yr		 +3.3 pct	    +2.0 pct     -0.4 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
